## 2. DOUBLE-BUFFER MATHEMATICS

### 2.1 Buffer Size Formula

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  BUFFER_CONSTRAINT: buffer_size ≥ (sample_rate × bit_depth × ch) × │
│                      (interrupt_interval_ms / 1000) + cache_line_pad│
│                                                                     │
│  Where:                                                             │
│    sample_rate  = 44100 Hz (standard audio)                         │
│    bit_depth    = 16 bits (2 bytes per sample)                      │
│    channels     = 2 (stereo)                                        │
│    interrupt_interval = 10 ms (100 Hz callback)                    │
│                                                                     │
│  Calculation:                                                       │
│    min_buffer = 44100 × 2 × 2 × 0.010 = 1764 bytes                 │
│    With 64-byte cache alignment: ceil(1764/64) × 64 = 1792 bytes    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### 2.2 DMA Transfer Timing

```
FIFO_CLOCK_DIVISOR = (I2S_CLKM_CONF_REG[17:12] >> 12) + 1
ACTUAL_BIT_CLOCK   = 160MHz / FIFO_CLOCK_DIVISOR
WS_CYCLE           = ACTUAL_BIT_CLOCK / (sample_rate × 2)
VALID_SETUP_CYCLES = (bit_depth == 16) ? 2 : 4
DMA_SAMPLE_RATE    = I2S_TX_CONF1_REG[7:0] + 1
```

### 2.3 Latency Calculation

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  TOTAL_LATENCY = (buffer_count × buffer_size × 8) / bit_rate   │
│                 + DMA_descriptor_travel_time                    │
│                 + I2S_FIFO_depth_samples × (1/sample_rate)      │
│                                                                 │
│  Example with 2 buffers × 1792 bytes @ 16-bit stereo @ 44100Hz: │
│  TOTAL_LATENCY = (2 × 1792 × 8) / (44100 × 2 × 16)             │
│                = 28672 / 1411200                                │
│                = 0.02032 seconds (20.32 ms)                    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

